sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor An as Analyst (Snowsight)
  participant SF as Snowflake: EAI UDFs
  participant IdP as Mock IdP (device flow)
  participant Ph as Phone / browser
  participant Br as Key broker
  participant QH as Snowflake: QUERY_HISTORY
  An->>SF: SELECT SOV_DEVICE_START()
  SF->>IdP: /device/authorize
  IdP-->>An: verification URL + user code
  An->>Ph: open URL, enter code
  Ph->>IdP: user + TOTP + justification + classes
  An->>SF: SET api_key = SOV_DEVICE_REDEEM(device_code)
  SF->>IdP: /token (single use) → id_token
  SF->>Br: /apikey(id_token, account, user, role, session, own query_id)
  Br->>QH: that query_id RUNNING, same user/role/session, calls REDEEM, no sibling?
  Br-->>SF: API key (stored only as hash, scoped to user+account+session)
  An->>SF: SELECT SOV_DECRYPT_2C(salary, 'salary', $api_key) …
  SF->>Br: /key(api_key, class, context, own query_id) — 1 per process
  Br->>Br: scope + classification check (no call-back if wrong)
  Br->>QH: one call-back per query (single-flight)
  Br-->>SF: data key → process memory for this query
  SF-->>An: plaintext rows (DECRYPT_RAW in SQL)
